# Git-ignored files to copy into new Claude Code worktrees (gitignore syntax).
#
# Nothing is needed yet:
# - .env is left out on purpose. Worktrees live under .claude/worktrees/, inside the
#   repository, and Honu looks for .env in and above the folder it runs in, so a
#   worktree finds the one at the repository root. A copy would only be another place
#   the key could leak from.
# - .build is left out too: SwiftPM's cache holds absolute paths, so each worktree
#   builds its own.
